cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "pdft: learning parametric quantum Fourier transforms via manifold optimization"
abstract: >-
  Python port of ParametricDFT.jl. pdft builds image bases as isometric tensor
  networks relaxed from fast transforms (the quantum Fourier transform, the
  DCT-IV and related topologies) and trains them with Riemannian optimization.
